thing about his past, why he exists, or what he is, but he must find out, or he will face the constant torment of being hunted by robots who don't want to die. Casshern leaves death wherever he goes, but he must face it if he is to find out the truth of this world.\n\n(Source: MAL Rewrite)\n\nNote: Created as an intended reboot of Casshern franchise."},"tags":[{"name":"Post-Apocalyptic","rank":96,"spoiler":false},{"name":"Philosophy","rank":95,"spoiler":false},{"name":"Dystopian","rank":94,"spoiler":false},{"name":"Robots","rank":93,"spoiler":false},{"name":"Super Power","rank":86,"spoiler":false},{"name":"Tragedy","rank":84,"spoiler":true},{"name":"Pandemic","rank":80,"spoiler":false},{"name":"Found Family","rank":79,"spoiler":true},{"name":"Episodic","rank":77,"spoiler":false},{"name":"Amnesia","rank":70,"spoiler":false},{"name":"Male Protagonist","rank":68,"spoiler":false},{"name":"Disability","rank":60,"spoiler":false},{"name":"Cyberpunk","rank":57,"spoiler":false},{"name":"Twins","rank":50,"spoiler":false},{"name":"Superhero","rank":48,"spoiler":false},{"name":"Lost Civilization","rank":46,"spoiler":false}],"titles":{"display":"Casshern Sins","english":"Casshern Sins","native":"キャシャーンSins","romaji":"Casshern Sins","synonyms":[{"language":"zh","source":"bangumi","value":"原罪的卡辛"},{"language":null,"source":"bangumi","value":"改造人卡辛"},{"language":null,"source":"bangumi","value":"再造人卡夏"}]},"trailer":{"id":"dxC2-ZorSrA","site":"youtube","thumbnail":"https://i.ytimg.com/vi/dxC2-ZorSrA/hqdefault.jpg"},"visibility":"general"}